1. Technical review of long-term and short-term memory for the on-device agent. The entire memory system was refactored, redesigning it based on Hermes' long-term and short-term memory on top of the original simple memory foundation.
2. Added Graphiti for external memory of the on-device agent. Basic functionality is in place, but integration is not fully complete and performance needs optimization.
3. To support the memory refactoring, the KV cache in mlx-vlm needs to be refactored, mainly to address performance issues; initial attempts are underway.
4. Department AI capability building: Aliy added a market analysis digital employee, mainly used as an agent for market analysis.
